It links against separately obtained DLSS5VKLayer source by bmitch87 and its
contributors, pinned to commit 117c9530834d37ef8dc7b371e36cc3fb507e6b6b:
https://github.com/bmitch87/DLSS5VKLayer

The build uses core/ngx_snippet.cpp, core/guard.cpp and their headers. The
upstream source is not bundled here. Its LICENSE and ATTRIBUTION.md must
accompany distribution of the adapter and its corresponding source.

The adapter corrects the upstream exception-success predicate and tracks
the upstream exception-handler registration, pinning its code for the process
lifetime because exception unwinding can retain dispatcher references. It
destroys GPU contexts independently and supplies engine resources directly
and does not use the upstream presentation layer, transport or optical flow.

NVIDIA runtime binaries are not included. NVIDIA, DLSS and NGX are NVIDIA
trademarks. This adapter's license grants no rights to NVIDIA binaries.
